    "title": "Drag on a charged sphere moving into a headwind",
    "text": "A charged sphere of cross-sectional area 20 cm^2 and drag coefficient 0.47 moves east at\n10 m/s through air of density 1.225 kg/m^3. The air itself is moving west at 5 m/s, so the\nsphere meets a 15 m/s headwind. What is the magnitude of the drag force on it?",
